T1  - Factors Driving the Popularity and Virality of COVID-19 Vaccine Discourse on Twitter: Text Mining and Data Visualization Study
AU  - Zhang, Jueman
AU  - Wang, Yi
AU  - Shi, Molu
AU  - Wang, Xiuli
JO  - JMIR Public Health and Surveillance
VL  - 7
IS  - 12
PY  - 2021
DA  - 2021/12/01/
